#6100
Immortal Map Room for the Black Winds~
   The Black Winds occupies an area to the west of the Rakshasa village and
extends to the coastal waters on the western edge of the world. 
~
61 cdgj 0
S
#6101
Black Winds~
   The sand spins violently, nearly becoming a whirlwind. Though the wind
whirls furiously, it doesn't appear to move in any particular direction. It
pelts your skin from all angles, and drives its way beneath your clothing.
~
61 fg 10
D1
It hurts too much to open your eyes.
~
~
0 0 6102
D2
You can make out no landmarks within the swirling sandstorm.
~
~
0 0 6104
S
#6102
Black Winds~
   The wind quickly picks up speed. A cloud of black sand whips around you,
tearing at your exposed flesh. Closing your eyes does little to block the
unforgiving winds and harsh, biting sands.
~
